  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You can triple the range of a power.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Enlarge Power.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> When you manifest a power with a range of close, medium, or long affected by Enlarge Power, its range is increased by +200%. An enlarged power with a range of close now has a range of 75 ft. + 15 ft./2 levels, while medium-range powers have a range of 300 ft. + 30 ft./level and long-range powers have a range of 1,200 ft. + 120 ft./level.</p>\n<p>Alternatively, you may expend a use of mythic power to manifest a power as an enlarged power (gaining only the normal benefits of an enlarged power, rather than the increased benefits outlined above) without increasing the number of power points spent or expending psionic focus.</p>\n<p><strong>Normal:</strong> An enlarged power with a range of close has a range of 50 ft. + 5 ft./level, while medium-range powers have a range of 200 ft. + 20 ft./level and long-range powers have a range of 800 ft. + 80 ft./level.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/mythic-enhancement-feats#toc16\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
